      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CELEBRITY CRUISE (5) has recorded two wins and two minor placings from the past five starts. Added to her reputation at her latest appearance when she got the job done by 3.5 metres over 1730m at Bathurst. Meets a similar line up so she can certainly score again. IRK MCGLURK (2) had a favourable gate and was too good at Young two runs ago. Drew wide last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 30 metres into fifth at Cowra over 1700m. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Finds a nice race and can turn things around. DIAMOND BIKINI (1) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 1700m at Cowra last time out. Each-way claims. IM HERE TO PARTY (3) is worth some thought despite his last-start seventh over 1700m at Cowra on September 20.",
